            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per eseguire il ciclo, assegna <code>true</code> a <code>isLooping</code> al di fuori del blocco di codice.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isLooping = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isLooping {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isLooping = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
