            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come facciamo a sapere che questo ciclo non si ferma?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keepGoing = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keepGoing {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;We will rock you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" keepGoing = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"We will rock you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will rock you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will rock you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché la variabile <code>keepGoing</code> non viene aggiornata a <code>false</code> all'interno del blocco di codice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché tutti i cicli <code>while</code> non si fermano</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Perché la variabile <code>keepGoing</code> viene aggiornata a <code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché la variabile <code>keepGoing</code> non viene aggiornata a <code>false</code> all'interno del blocco di codice.</p></body></html>"
